   438	      # must still peel to this run's GITHUB_SHA immediately before
   439	      # publish. A deleted tag (empty resolve) and a moved tag both
   440	      # abort. This step sits AFTER the production-npm environment
   441	      # approval by job order, so a stale approval cannot race past it.
   442	      # -----------------------------------------------------------------
   443	      - name: Assert remote tag still points at this run's SHA
